Andrew D. Hilton wrote:
[snip lots of good advice on how to solve the horrific ways to die]

In fact, I am in the process of devising a plan to overcome each of
these issues. Here we go:

1.  End-game riders, especially death.
Solution: Death ray for everybody except death. Ranged daggers, magic
missile, polearm against death. Scrolls of earth to build a fort if
they get too close.  Boots of jumping.

2.  Hit by disintegration or death ray because I  accidentally took off
my amulet of reflection.

Solution: So don't do that, then.

3.  While nurse-dancing, smack cockatrice with bare hands.
Solution: Be aware of the possibility,  and be very careful while nurse
dancing.
4.  Otherwise goof up severely while nurse-dancing.
Ditto.
5.  Choke to death by eating too much.

So don't do that.

6.  Put wand of cancellation in bag of holding (not death, but still
reasonably catastrophic).

Exercise caution when using the "apply" command. Store wand in my
oilskin sack. Store a selection of critical goodies in the sack so I'm
not hosed if I do make that mistake.

7. Have nymph steal my means of levitation while over water.

Stay away from nymphs and engage with ranged weapons.

8. Drowned by eel or kraken.

Genocide eels.  If not feasible, use polearm and engage from distance.
Possibly wear oilskin cloak (which I have).

9. Wiz gates in Demogorgon.

Kill Rodney quickly so he doesn't get the chance. If he does --
A) Use wand of fire to burn "E" on ground.
B) Death ray rodney.
C) Cancel demogorgon.
D) Port to stairs.
E) Burn "E" again.
F) Kill Demogorgon to death with weapon of my choosing.


10.  Escape dungeon without AoY.

Double check I have the amulet before leaving.  Putting it in a BOH is
a good suggestion.

11. Killed by air elemental on Plane of Air.

Wands of teleport,  charm monster, speed, potions of healing.

12. Rodney steals means of magic resistance,  uses touch of death.

Possess a means of MR he won't steal.

13. Starve to death by not watching food status.

So don't do that.

14. Knocked unconscious by rotten food while eating, monster comes up
and kills me while still unconscious.

Bless all food -- blessed food is never rotten.

15. Stone grenade or rubber chicken wielded by monster.

Have lizard corpse handy.

16. Get smacked by a PC wielding Vorpal Blade.

When approaching PC, try to make sure of what he's wielding. If not
sure, engage from distance.

And now, two new ones --

17.  Fall into pit with cockatrice/fall through trapdoor/ otherwise
mishandle cockatrice.

So just don't use 'em.  If I have to,  put on ring of levitation and
not use corpse until I'm no longer on the ground.

Thanks to poster #2 for this reminder!

17. Green slime

Engage slime from distance.  Have no immediate means of fire, so
acquire a scroll of fire,
a potion of oil, or be prepared to 'port to a fire trap.  The last is
chancy because I might "escape" it.... but engaging from distance
should be sufficient precaution. I haven't been slimed in my last 20
games.


Of course, it's the thing I haven't thought of that will kill me.   I
wonder what I'm missing? 

